  <goal>ICostEnvelopeChecker's implementation queries actual month-to-date cost for the customer's subscription via REST or the CostManagement SDK, classifying drift against the pricing model's envelope (§15 #14 per this project's plan.md) -- Fail if drift exceeds the documented threshold (per this project's risk register: cost drift &gt; 20% fails the run).</goal>

  <context>
